    cml:operator "Overlaps" ;
    cml:logicSummary "The Commonwealth's liability for fees overlaps with its intention to be notionally liable." ;
    cml:premiseText "(1) The Commonwealth is not liable to pay a fee that is payable under this Act to a part of the Commonwealth that is not a separate legal entity." ;
    cml:conclusionText "However, it is the Parliament’s intention that the Commonwealth should be notionally liable to pay such a fee." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
